"""TECH · Tech. Gadgets that blink; nothing branded, no digits, no letters. Same method as lib/food.py: hand-authored
character grids at final size, hue-shifted ramps shared across the set, sel-out outlines in each material's darkest tone,
chunky glints on glass and metal, light from the top-left. Desk gadgets ~24 px, hand-held ~16 px, floor items 32-48 px.
Most items carry a small loop: an LED blink, a cursor, a glint, a spinning reel, a pulsing cone."""
